<title>USA: FOCUS-Spring gasoline price spike seen short-lived.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-Spring gasoline price spike seen short-lived.</headline>
<byline>Matt Daily</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Despite warnings that low gasoline stocks will force a repeat of last spring's price surge, industry analysts said any spikes should be only short-lived.</p>
<p>&quot;The odds are in favor of a similar price move (to 1996's Post-Gulf War record gasoline levels), but they essentially collapsed after that,&quot; Tom Knight, a trader with FINA Inc noted.</p>
